    <briefdescription>
<para>Default-density term structure. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This abstract class acts as an adapter to <ref refid="default_probability_term_structure" kindref="compound">DefaultProbabilityTermStructure</ref> allowing the programmer to implement only the <computeroutput>defaultDensityImpl(Time)</computeroutput> method in derived classes.</para><para>Survival/default probabilities and hazard rates are calculated from default densities. </para>    </detaileddescription>
